## Proposed Changes

### STT Module
#### [NEW] `frontend/stt/config.js`
- Defines `STT_CONFIG` with `modelId: "Xenova/whisper-small.en"`, `language: "english"`, `quantized: true`.

#### [NEW] `frontend/stt/audioCapture.js`
- Implements mic permissions, Web Audio API resampling, 16kHz mono `Float32Array` output, volume metering, and error handling.

#### [NEW] `frontend/stt/inference.js`
- Implements transformers.js pipeline singleton, model caching, progress callbacks, and `transcribe(audioData)`.

#### [NEW] `frontend/stt/sttWorker.js`
- Off-thread Web Worker wrapper for transformers.js inference to keep UI 100% responsive.

#### [NEW] `frontend/stt/outputHandler.js`
- Implements text insertion, cursor manipulation, and chat input flow integration.

#### [NEW] `frontend/stt/sttController.js`
- Implements unified STT lifecycle, state machine, and UI event binding.

### Frontend Integration
#### [MODIFY] `frontend/sidepanel/sidepanel.html`
- Add microphone button (`#micBtn`) and audio recording / model loading status bar.

#### [MODIFY] `frontend/sidepanel/sidepanel.css`
- Add modern dark-theme styling for recording animation, microphone pulse, and progress bar.

#### [MODIFY] `frontend/sidepanel/sidepanel.js`
- Initialize `STTController` and bind `#micBtn` to recording/transcription flow.

#### [MODIFY] `frontend/build.ps1`
- Add `"stt"` to `$SharedFolders` so extension build scripts include the new module.

